347
00:50:15.403 --> 00:50:17.013
Are you enjoying this, like...

348
00:50:17.187 --> 00:50:19.059
No.

349
00:50:19.233 --> 00:50:21.670
I'm not enjoying this.

350
00:50:21.844 --> 00:50:24.803
