452
01:04:32.215 --> 01:04:34.087
<i>Please, would you do it for me?</i>

453
01:04:34.261 --> 01:04:37.220
<i>You have to go up now.</i>

454
01:04:37.394 --> 01:04:38.918
<i>Please.</i>

455
01:04:45.446 --> 01:04:49.319
<i>I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry.</i>

456
01:04:49.493 --> 01:04:52.409
<i>It's okay, Drew, it's okay.</i>

457
01:04:52.583 --> 01:04:54.803
<i>Let it go.</i>

458
01:04:59.025 --> 01:05:00.896
